From e1e2aa7f2aaefef1c7bef1d9b35897dcc2e16354 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: patch <patch@local>
Date: Thu, 29 Oct 2026 19:19:59 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat(payments): multi-gateway support (YooKassa, Tinkoff,
 Ozon, CloudPayments, Sber, VTB, MKB)
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Adds a provider-abstraction layer so any payment gateway can be plugged in
without touching route handlers. Existing single-provider (YooKassa-only)
code is preserved as a special case.

New module: src/lib/payments/
  - types.ts        — IPaymentProvider interface, PaymentMethod, Receipt, etc.
  - registry.ts     — provider lookup by name, method→provider routing
  - service.ts      — orchestration: createPayment, completePayment, refund
  - receipts.ts     — 54-ФЗ fiscal cheque builder (VAT, payment_subject=service)
  - ip-whitelist.ts — provider IP range verification
  - providers/      — 7 provider implementations
      * yookassa.ts      — fully implemented (cards, SBP, ЮMoney, SberPay, T-Pay, Yandex Pay)
      * tinkoff.ts       — fully implemented (cards, SBP, T-Pay) with SHA-256 signing
      * cloudpayments.ts — fully implemented (cards, SBP, ЮMoney, SberPay, T-Pay)
      * ozon.ts          — implemented (Ozon Card, cards, SBP)
      * sberbank.ts      — stub (fill in once credentials issued)
      * vtb.ts           — stub
      * mkb.ts           — stub

Schema changes (prisma/schema.prisma):
  - Payment.paymentProvider now stores YOOKASSA|TINKOFF|CLOUDPAYMENTS|SBER|OZON|VTB|MKB
  - New index on (paymentProvider, status) for analytics
  - New model PaymentWebhookEvent (durable idempotency + audit log)

API changes:
  - POST /api/payments — accepts new {provider, method} alongside legacy {paymentMethod}
  - POST /api/payments/webhook — universal endpoint, provider detected from
    x-payment-provider header or ?provider= query param
  - POST /api/payments/[id]/init-provider — universal provider init (replaces /init-yookassa)

UI:
  - PaymentPageClient now renders QR for SBP (uses qrcode.react — already a dep)
  - New PaymentMethodSelector component (radio group with provider icons)
  - New CheckoutDialog modal — promo code + method selector + redirect flow

Env vars (.env.example):
  - YOOKASSA_*  (existing, kept)
  - TINKOFF_TERMINAL_KEY, TINKOFF_PASSWORD
  - CLOUDPAYMENTS_PUBLIC_ID, CLOUDPAYMENTS_API_SECRET
  - SBER_USERNAME, SBER_PASSWORD
  - OZON_CLIENT_ID, OZON_API_KEY, OZON_WEBHOOK_SECRET, OZON_API_URL
  - VTB_MERCHANT_ID, VTB_SECRET_KEY
  - MKB_MERCHANT_ID, MKB_SECRET_KEY

Backward compatibility:
  - Legacy paymentMethod values (sbp/yookassa/tinkoff/card) still accepted
  - Existing /init-yookassa endpoint preserved (calls into new abstraction)
  - Existing webhook signature verification (HMAC with PAYMENT_WEBHOOK_SECRET)
    kept as fallback for providers without native signing
